{"id":"n58144-1-7","stage":1,"title":"아흔 · 九十","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58144-1-7-1","ko":"사람들은 몇 명이나 모였어?","zh":"来了多少人啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"사람들은","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람들은","audio":"/audio/f7f40c6478ace61ef47f.mp3"}},{"text":"몇","meaning":"几，多少","explanation":"몇：几，多少","readings":[{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66235","senseId":"2","lemma":"몇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}},{"text":"명이나","meaning":"个，名","explanation":"명：个，名；이나：表示不止预期的数量、举例或退而求其次等，需结合整句语气。","readings":[{"term":"명","audio":"/audio/9f96b8e22cc06bfafc54.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70812","senseId":"1","lemma":"명","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"명이나","audio":"/audio/aa9f4c774afa196a54bb.mp3"}},{"text":"모였어?","meaning":"被召集，被集中","explanation":"모이다：被召集，被集中；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"모이다","audio":"/audio/ea6fae0a54340254cbe6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91162","senseId":"6","lemma":"모이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모였어","audio":"/audio/70dcfbf847be3e7eaf90.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"37ca98883f5001d4","term":"몇","zh":"几，多少","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3","entryId":"66235","definition":"用于询问不知道的数目。","pronunciation":["멷"]},{"id":"9f96b8e22cc06bfa","term":"명","zh":"个，名","audio":"/audio/9f96b8e22cc06bfafc54.mp3","entryId":"70812","definition":"计算人数的数量单位。","pronunciation":["명"]},{"id":"ea6fae0a54340254","term":"모이다","zh":"被召集，被集中","audio":"/audio/ea6fae0a54340254cbe6.mp3","entryId":"91162","definition":"人们聚集在一起或加入某个团体。","pronunciation":["모이다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6ac60abe835e616e9680.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n58144-1-7-2","ko":"아흔 명쯤 모였으니 앞으로 열 명 정도만 더 오면 백 명이에요.","zh":"大概有九十人，再有十来人就到一百人了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아흔","meaning":"九十","explanation":"아흔：九十","readings":[{"term":"아흔","audio":"/audio/87bbeaa4582f0895f511.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58144","senseId":"1","lemma":"아흔","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아흔","audio":"/audio/87bbeaa4582f0895f511.mp3"}},{"text":"명쯤","meaning":"个，名","explanation":"명：个，名；쯤：名词后缀，构成派生名词。","readings":[{"term":"명","audio":"/audio/9f96b8e22cc06bfafc54.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70812","senseId":"1","lemma":"명","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"명쯤","audio":"/audio/96bd97d768a073d1df34.mp3"}},{"text":"모였으니","meaning":"被召集，被集中","explanation":"모이다：被召集，被集中；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；으니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"모이다","audio":"/audio/ea6fae0a54340254cbe6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91162","senseId":"6","lemma":"모이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모였으니","audio":"/audio/971f19549a811002e137.mp3"}},{"text":"앞으로","meaning":"以后，未来","explanation":"앞：以后，未来；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"4","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앞으로","audio":"/audio/cb4897c6b6949e02da6d.mp3"}},{"text":"열","meaning":"十","explanation":"열：十","readings":[{"term":"열","audio":"/audio/6f4112362e973dd65e65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67805","senseId":"1","lemma":"열","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"열","audio":"/audio/6f4112362e973dd65e65.mp3"}},{"text":"명","meaning":"个，名","explanation":"명：个，名","readings":[{"term":"명","audio":"/audio/9f96b8e22cc06bfafc54.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70812","senseId":"1","lemma":"명","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"명","audio":"/audio/9f96b8e22cc06bfafc54.mp3"}},{"text":"정도만","meaning":"左右","explanation":"정도：左右；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"정도","audio":"/audio/1a771e4b7f99176bc0a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70876","senseId":"3","lemma":"정도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정도만","audio":"/audio/6dfad62575943b74c44f.mp3"}},{"text":"더","meaning":"再，多","explanation":"더：再，多","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"1","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}},{"text":"오면","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오면","audio":"/audio/db4c994ab297c56bbe00.mp3"}},{"text":"백","meaning":"百","explanation":"백：百","readings":[{"term":"백","audio":"/audio/f30a48779ab0b5cdf1b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36019","senseId":"1","lemma":"백","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"백","audio":"/audio/f30a48779ab0b5cdf1b3.mp3"}},{"text":"명이에요.","meaning":"个，名","explanation":"명：个，名；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"명","audio":"/audio/9f96b8e22cc06bfafc54.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70812","senseId":"1","lemma":"명","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"명이에요","audio":"/audio/966fa034eb6ee9a8dd40.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"87bbeaa4582f0895","term":"아흔","zh":"九十","audio":"/audio/87bbeaa4582f0895f511.mp3","entryId":"58144","definition":"十的九倍的数目的。","pronunciation":["아흔"]},{"id":"9f96b8e22cc06bfa","term":"명","zh":"个，名","audio":"/audio/